<<set $hypnosis_potency to Math.ceil($hypnosis_traits.devotion / 2) || 1>>
<<set $phase2 to "none">>
<<if $gwylanSeen.includes("garden_seen")>>
	Gwylan takes the bottle under one arm and leads you through to the garden.
<<else>>
	<<He>> ties a black blindfold over your eyes before you go anywhere. "My garden stays my garden. Nothing personal."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> walks you through two doors and a turn you can't follow. The air changes from dust to wet earth,
	and <<he>> lifts the blindfold off.
	<<if !$gwylanSeen.includes("garden")>>
		<<set $gwylanSeen.pushUnique("garden")>>
		Stone tiles run between beds of flowers and herbs. A fence of crossed wooden stakes closes the whole
