	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Under the covered section <<he>> has already laid out folded quilts, a shallow bowl, and a jug of water.
<<He>> sets the bottle beside them and starts grinding herbs into a cup.
<<if $worn.handheld.name isnot "naked" or $worn.bag.name isnot "naked">>
	You put your <<= [$worn.handheld, $worn.bag].filter(item => item.name !== "naked").map(item => item.name).join(" and ")>> down out of the way. <<handheldundress "gwylanStrongWings">>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> pours hot water through the grounds and holds the cup out to you. "Drink this first,
if you want the easy version. It takes the worst of the pain off."
